# Data Flow - Pipeline Diagram Template

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph "Ingestion"
        Source[Data Source] --> Collector[Collector]
        Collector --> Validator[Validator]
    end
    
    subgraph "Processing"
        Validator --> Transformer[Transformer]
        Transformer --> Enricher[Enricher]
        Enricher --> Aggregator[Aggregator]
    end
    
    subgraph "Storage"
        Aggregator --> HotStore[(Hot Storage)]
        Aggregator --> ColdStore[(Cold Storage)]
    end
    
    subgraph "Consumption"
        HotStore --> API[API Layer]
        ColdStore --> Analytics[Analytics]
        API --> Dashboard[Dashboard]
        Analytics --> Reports[Reports]
    end
    
    style Validator fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828
    style Enricher fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style Aggregator fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
```

## Usage
Map your data pipeline stages from ingestion to consumption.